    "body": "## Authorized bounded scope\nC266 implements the source/program/object provenance binding prerequisite for the queued C260 hinge comparator. The owner's November 18 Prompt 1 authorizes selecting this coherent slice. Starting main: 7818de1f17e379df50680cb94347ce86bcabb8a5, tree 4c916307ffd26f4bc17435d3a73cbdbc5a50301e. C265 is complete with confirmed saved v2 handoff, closed issue 256, only main and no open PRs.\n\nOwner: c266-root-2593880e88fd. Branch: work/c266-hinge-input-binding.\nOwned source: docs/engineering/localized-repair-c266/, docs/workflow/tasks/C266/. Director owns shared workflow/status publication under a separately acquired conditional main lease. Independent workers use disjoint files; only Director publishes.\n\n## Acceptance\nImplement bind_hinge_inputs(source_files, raw) from actual supplied bytes using exact pinned C265 source, C261 raw artifact and permitted C257 lexical/module/occurrence utilities. Independently bind canonical manifest, program revision, source-unit claims, the complete object identity/path set, classes, exact source spans, and repeated mapping claims including path steps, declaration definition IDs, generated input/entry witnesses and generated ancestry. Support changed source with correctly rebound artifact provenance, reordered nodes and legal opaque keys. Reject missing, stale, contradictory, wrongly typed or unsupported bindings with bounded typed failures and exact available input identities. Do not call ownership/follow comparators or product parser/evaluator/exporter.\n\nThis is explicitly an input-association prerequisite, not compare_hinges. Hinge fields, joint-set equality and ordered endpoint agreement remain unqualified even if binding passes. Source-only site facts and absent direct artifact authority remain distinct. No historical endpoint admission, full source/GLB validity, site-pose evaluation, accepted revisions, edit atomicity, rebuilds, native/model trials or scientific advantage claim. No existing source/runtime/fixtures/contracts/workflows/budgets change.\n\n## Plan and completion\nPublish requirements, plan, session/capabilities and an early recoverable checkpoint before implementation. Implement with independent public-API controls, run complete relevant C253/C255/C256/C257/C258/C261/C265/C266 cohorts and documentation/workflow checks, obtain actual independent review, integrate by verified lease and expected-head PR merge, test actual main, verify branch retention/deletion, then verify and save the exact online browser-session ZIP in existing OntoKin folder and record the external receipt. Stop after C266. Historical C262 remains unchanged; the shallow local seed is not full graph retention evidence.",
